# Canonical starting puzzle: every executable byte is a literal binary token.
11111010 # instruction | CLI | Keep the final halt stopped.
10111000 11111110 01111111 # instruction | MOV AX,7FFE | This positive signed value is one below the boundary case.
00000101 00000001 00000000 # instruction | ADD AX,1 | The result 7FFF is still positive and sets no signed overflow.
11110100 # instruction | HLT | Stop before the requested sign transition.
